{
  "description": "Futures account history paging (GET /api/v1/futures/fills and /api/v1/futures/funding), for an SDK's iterate-all helper. Rules: (1) the cursor is opaque text, sent back exactly as received (percent-encoded per RFC 3986 in the query; the server decodes it to the same text); (2) a page may be short, even empty, and still carry a next_cursor: keep paging until next_cursor is null; (3) an EMPTY page whose next_cursor equals the cursor just sent means the provider is busy: wait (the SDK's normal backoff) and request the same cursor again, at most max_retries times (default 3) in a row, then fail with a retryable error (code PAGING_STALLED, a local error) without returning a partial result as complete; (4) has_account false ends iteration with no rows; (5) the first request sends no cursor. Each case lists the pages in order: `request_cursor` is what the SDK must send (null = parameter absent), `response` what the server answers. `expect.ids` are the yielded row ids in order.",
  "operation": "GET /api/v1/futures/fills",
  "max_retries": 3,
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "short_pages_until_null",
      "pages": [
        {
          "request_cursor": null,
          "response": {
            "has_account": true,
            "fills": [
              {
                "id": "f1",
                "order_id": "o1",
                "coin": "BTC",
                "side": "buy",
                "price": "60000.0",
                "size": "0.01",
                "direction": "Open Long",
                "closed_pnl": "0",
                "taker": true,
                "time": 1790000000300
              }
            ],
            "next_cursor": "c:AAA1"
          }
        },
        {
          "request_cursor": "c:AAA1",
          "response": {
            "has_account": true,
            "fills": [],
            "next_cursor": "c:AAA2"
          }
        },
        {
          "request_cursor": "c:AAA2",
          "response": {
            "has_account": true,
            "fills": [
              {
                "id": "f2",
                "order_id": "o2",
                "coin": "BTC",
                "side": "buy",
                "price": "60000.0",
                "size": "0.01",
                "direction": "Open Long",
                "closed_pnl": "0",
                "taker": true,
                "time": 1790000000200
